{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"For a quick check, decimal 25 is binary 11001, octal 31 and hexadecimal 19. It converts signed integers between the bases 2, 8, 10 and 16; fractions and base prefixes such as 0b are not accepted.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"binary-converter UI copy.body","detected_language":"fr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"binary-converter.copy.body","keys":["binary-converter.copy.body"],"locale":"fr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Pour une vérification rapide, décimal ZXQPH0000QXZ est binaire ZXQPH0001QXZ, octal ZXQPH0002QXZ et hexadécimal ZXQPH0003QXZ.Il convertit les entiers signés entre les bases ZXQPH0004QXZ, ZXQPH0005QXZ, ZXQPH0006QXZ et ZXQPH0007QXZ; les fractions et les préfixes de base tels que ZXQPH0008QXZb ne sont pas acceptés.","record_id":"4e9c5425d54aa3920697d1d8e0603ab94ce4485f881761055400c719516d4615","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.1869934327500005,"source":"For a quick check, decimal 25 is binary 11001, octal 31 and hexadecimal 19. It converts signed integers between bases 2, 8, 10 and 16; fractions and base prefixes such as 0b are not accepted.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"331febe3067d224381cbf1fc4630ad27d6915538b66e3d7a756978f86dee415e","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Pour une vérification rapide, décimal 25 est binaire 11001, octal 31 et hexadécimal 19.Il convertit les entiers signés entre les bases 2, 8, 10 et 16; les fractions et les préfixes de base tels que 0b ne sont pas acceptés.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
